{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>For all the wealth.</b> Like כִּי צָחַקְתְּ (Genesis 18:15) — we have no expectation of inheriting from our father's house; rather, all the wealth that Elohim has rescued from him belongs to us and to our children alone." "<b>And now.</b> Since you have seen that he accepted an evil report about you, there is reason to fear he may seize [the property] by force." "<b>All that Elohim has said.</b> Do accordingly — conduct yourself and go, and do not take leave on your own authority."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:45.550936993Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}